WEBVTT

01:03:28.871 --> 01:03:31.246
And I think entrepreneurship
and startups are

01:03:31.246 --> 01:03:34.829
a wonderful way to do that. You know, we
get all these great software companies.

01:03:35.079 --> 01:03:37.538
But I also think it's like how
we're going to get ajai,

01:03:37.663 --> 01:03:40.496
how we're going to get nuclear fusion, how
we're going to get life extension.

01:03:40.788 --> 01:03:43.788
And like on any of those topics are
a long list of other things

01:03:43.788 --> 01:03:46.413
I could point to. There's like
a number of startups that

01:03:46.413 --> 01:03:49.829
I think are doing incredible work, some
of which will actually deliver.

01:03:50.996 --> 01:03:55.913
It is a truly amazing thing when you put
the camera back and to believe that

01:03:56.246 --> 01:03:58.413
a human being could be
lying awake at night

01:03:58.413 --> 01:04:02.663
and something pops inside their
mind as a patterning of